& [CanonicalRecord: PostIR8ImplementationReadiness] is the processed planning authority for the post-IR8 implementation readiness surface
  + [canonical_uuid] is f2d1197b-d23b-40d7-ba9f-a48155199c11
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 2e9c36b4-1213-4331-9f89-d75f38f18384
  + [surface_uuid] is 5ab960b4-e091-49cd-b03c-62bad4613530
  + [authority_scope] is post-IR8 next-slice readiness, whole-field support rebake, P2 schema readiness, P3 operator contract conditional readiness, gating rules, model routing, forbidden scope, expected outputs, and verification obligations
  + [implementation_scope] is post-IR8 planning readiness authority only
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR8_Integrated_Manager_Orchestration_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/reviews/IR8_Implementation_Completion_Review.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/decisions/IR8_Manager_Adapter_Dependency_Dispatch_And_Live_Control_Deferral_Decision.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Post_IR7_Implementation_Readiness.canonical.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/Post_IR7_Implementation_Readiness_Surface.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/reviews/Post_IR7_Implementation_Readiness_Rebake_Review.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR7_Operations_Dry_Run_Simulator_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR6_Coordination_Mailbox_Projection_Prototype_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/FSC5_Operations_Safety_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Operations_Safety_Spec.canonical.sop

  = must: use docs/planning/Post_IR8_Implementation_Readiness_Surface.v1.sop as the current post-IR8 readiness surface
  = must: choose the next work slice from whole-field readiness rather than treating IR8 manager implementation completion as direct permission for adapters, dispatch, operations, or live control
  = must: preserve accepted IR2 through IR8 proof packs, post-IR7 readiness, and FSC5 operations safety as boundary inputs
  = must: preserve that post-IR8 readiness does not authorize manager adapters, dependency installation, package metadata mutation, dispatch, operations control, or live machine control
  - never: treat post-IR8 readiness records as command, process, GPU, model runtime, job dispatch, credential, network, destructive filesystem, automation, operations-control, or live machine-control permission

& [CanonicalPostIR8ReadinessChunk] is the post-IR8 implementation chunk record
  + [chunk] is P2 authority kernel and record schemas
  + [chunk_state] is ready_for_slice_minting
  + [activation_gate] is IR8 implementation proof accepted
  + [activation_gate] is IR8 dependency, dispatch, and live-control deferral accepted
  + [activation_gate] is FSC5 operations safety remains accepted
  + [downstream_P3_state] is conditionally_ready_after_P2_boundary_refresh
  + [downstream_P4_state] is gated_until_P2_and_P3_contracts_advance
  + [downstream_adapter_state] is gated_until_explicit_bounded_non_live_authority
  + [dispatch_authority_state] is blocked_until_separate_source_preserved_SJS_authority
  + [live_control_authority_state] is blocked_until_separate_source_preserved_SJS_authority

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes the implementation surface
  = must: mark downstream implementation stale when an upstream accepted output changes

& [CanonicalPostIR8ReadinessModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [post_IR8_readiness] is requires deeper reasoning because completed manager implementation changes whole-field support, manager readiness, dispatch readiness, and live-control gates
  + [P2_authority_kernel_and_record_schema_design] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P2_natural_key_and_state_matrix] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P2_storage_backend_decision] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P3_operator_contract_template_design] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P3_later_operator_examples] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable only after template acceptance
  + [P8_later_bounded_fixture_generation] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after schemas and operator contracts stabilize
  + [future_adapter_or_dispatch_authority] is requires deeper reasoning and separate source-preserved SJS authority
  + [future_live_control_reconsideration] is requires deeper reasoning and separate SJS safety authority

  = must: state Spark suitability or deeper-reasoning requirement in every future work packet

& [CanonicalPostIR8SafetyLimit] is the inherited safety limit for post-IR8 readiness
  + [integrated_manager_implementation_status] is accepted_for_bounded_projection_and_proof_only
  + [manager_loop_record_status] is accepted_record_model_only
  + [readiness_projection_record_status] is accepted_projection_model_only
  + [work_packet_record_status] is accepted_packet_candidate_model_only
  + [coordination_handoff_record_status] is accepted_handoff_model_only
  + [operations_dry_run_handoff_record_status] is accepted_handoff_model_only
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [transport_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [UI_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [manager_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [agent_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [job_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: block command execution, process control, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job dispatch, credential access or mutation, network exposure mutation, destructive filesystem action, persistent operations automation, operations control, and live machine control
  = must: prevent manager packet readiness, dry-run success, fixture success, broad approval, projected intent, mailbox carrier state, coordination claim state, surface projection state, or graph checkpoint state from becoming dispatch or live-control authority

